               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Education:  Bachelor of Arabic Language Al-Azhar University â€“ Z</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Education:  Bachelor of Arabic Language Al-Azhar University â€“ Zagazig 2009 Diploma in Computer Science AskPc Academy 2008 Graduate Diploma in Education 2013 </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Certifications  â€¢ Google: The Basics of Digital Marketing, 2019</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Certifications  â€¢ Google: The Basics of Digital Marketing, 2019 â€¢ MCT: Microsoft Certified Trainer, 2013, 2017, 2018, 2021 â€¢ ICDL v4.0: International Computer Driving License, 2008 â€¢ Master MOS: Microsoft Office Specialist (Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Access), 2010 â€¢ A+ Vision: Maintenance, 2006 â€¢ CPSD: Certified Photoshop Designer, 2007 â€¢ ACWSD: Ask Pc Certified Website Designer, 2007 â€¢ Microsoft: MCSA Server 2012</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Tools, software and experience</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Tools, software and experience</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Contact me</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Contact me</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Web Development &amp; Design:  â€¢ Django-based Website Development â€¢</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Web Development &amp; Design:  â€¢ Django-based Website Development â€¢ PHP, WordPress, Python Django â€¢ Front-end &amp; Back-end Web Development â€¢ Graphic Design &amp; Print Management </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Professional Experience  Technical Support Supervisor - Riyadh </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Professional Experience  Technical Support Supervisor - Riyadh Season 2023 - 2024 â€¢ Supervised a team of technical support staff and managed ticket bookings on Webook.com, ensuring seamless operations during the event. System Administrator &amp; IT Trainer Al-Manar Language School American Section, IGCSE 2013 - 2023 â€¢ Managed system administration, network support, and technical support for the American section. â€¢ Provided IT training, mentoring over 8,000 interns. â€¢ Designed and maintained the school's website and handled graphic design tasks. Print Manager &amp; IT Specialist Digital Print Gate, Qatif - KSA 2011 - 2012 â€¢ Managed print production, account management, and IT tasks. â€¢ Developed and maintained websites, and provided graphic design services. Print Manager &amp; Graphic Designer Al-Ahram Newspaper, El-Maadi Branch 2006 - 2008 â€¢ Directed the Graphic and Training Department. â€¢ Managed print operations and provided technical support. </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Skills System Administration &amp; Technical Support:       Microso</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Skills System Administration &amp; Technical Support:       Microsoft Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint), Network Device Configuration, PC Maintenance, Windows OS Troubleshooting, Security Management, CCTV, and more.  Web Development &amp; Design:       Proficient in Django, PHP, WordPress, front-end &amp; back-end development, and graphic design.  Tools &amp; Software:        Experienced in using Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign for graphic and print design. Expertise in Python, Bootstrap, HTML, CSS for web development.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>2024</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>2024</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
