               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>I worked on the branding project for "Mata'am Limo," a kitchen </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>I worked on the branding project for "Mata'am Limo," a kitchen known for offering delicious meals at reasonable prices. My tasks included designing the logo, print materials, and managing their social media pages. Additionally, I designed the menu, established the brandâ€™s color signature, and selected fonts that represent the brandâ€™s identity.</photoshop:LayerText>
